e system access; GOOD scopes, validates, and sanitizes paths to prevent traversal.\n\n4. **IPC channel whitelist:**\n   Every `ipcMain.handle` channel should validate its arguments. Treat all renderer input as untrusted. Map out all channels and verify each one: Does it validate input types? Does it check authorization? Does it prevent path traversal in file operations?\n\n5. **`webSecurity: true`** (MUST stay enabled)\n   Disabling this removes same-origin policy. Never disable it, even for development.\n\nI'll scan your `electron/main.ts` and `electron/preload.ts` for these patterns and report any exposures."}, "adversarial": false, "notes": "Electron IPC is a unique attack surface for indiiOS desktop. contextIsolation and contextBridge review are the key checks."}
